# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Documents — never committed (PDF, Word, PowerPoint, Excel, other office
# formats). Project documentation lives in Markdown (README.md, docs/*.md,
# DATA_SOURCES.md), which is NOT ignored.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
