*.PDF
*.doc
*.docx
*.docm
*.dot
*.dotx
*.odt
*.rtf
*.pages
*.ppt
*.pptx
*.pptm
*.potx
*.odp
*.key
*.xls
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.ods
*.numbers
~$*
*.tmp

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data — third-party data are fetched at run time and never redistributed
# here (see DATA_SOURCES.md).
